[51.966697, "o", "\r\u001b[2KI’ll start by inspecting the repository structure, existing content, and workflows so I can understand what needs to be transformed and what security issues may\r\nexist.\r\n\r\n```\r\npwd && printf '\\n--- top-level ---\\n' && ls -la && printf '\\n--- all files ---\\n' && find . -maxdepth 4 -type f -not -path './.git/*' -print | sort | sed -n \r\n'1,200p'\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
