[277.104677, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe initial pages are generated. I noticed the hero used unsupported aggregate metrics, so I’ll replace those with facts explicitly present in the CV before \r\nfinalizing the build and deployment files.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app/my_website && python3 - <<'PY'\r\nfrom pathlib import Path\r\npath = Path('scripts/generate_site.py')\r\ntext = path.read_text()\r\nold = '''          <ul class=\"hero-facts\" aria-label=\"Profile highlights\">\r\n            <li><strong>15+</strong> peer-reviewed works</li>\r\n            <li><strong>20</strong> graduate researchers mentored</li>\r\n            <li><strong>3</strong> open research tools</li>\r\n          </ul>'''\r\nnew = '''          <ul class=\"hero-facts\" aria-label=\"Profile highlights\">\r\n            <li><strong>PhD</strong> Computational Biology</li>\r\n            <li><strong>8</strong> Ph.D. students supervised</li>\r\n            <li><strong>12</strong> Master’s theses mentored</li>\r\n          </ul>'''\r\nassert old in text\r\npath.write_text(text.replace(old, new))\r\nPY\r\npython3 scripts/generate_site.py\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[277.104957, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
