[299.979635, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe workflow and build script were written, but the 404 insertion patch failed due to a quoting error. I’ll fix the generator properly, regenerate all pages, \r\nand then run the full local build plus validation checks.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app/my_website && grep -n 'publications.html\\|^    }' scripts/generate_site.py | tail -20 && nl -ba scripts/generate_site.py | sed -n '470,520p'\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠼\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
