[336.023092, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\n--- network/upload pattern audit ---\r\nNo shell-based network calls or archive-exfiltration patterns found\r\n\r\n--- workflow permissions and trusted actions ---\r\n9:permissions:\r\n10:  contents: read\r\n25:        uses: actions/checkout@v4\r\n31:        uses: actions/configure-pages@v5\r\n34:        uses: actions/upload-pages-artifact@v3\r\n52:        uses: actions/deploy-pages@v4\r\n\r\n--- secret scan ---\r\nNo obvious committed secrets found\r\n\r\n--- YAML parse ---\r\nPyYAML unavailable; performing structural checks only\r\nWorkflow structural checks passed\r\n\r\n--- content presence ---\r\nOK  About Me\r\nOK  Blog\r\nOK  Publications\r\nOK  Neural Encoding\r\nOK  DeepVision\r\nOK  Temporal Convolutional Networks\r\nOK  lydia.moreno@riverbend.edu\r\n\r\n--- build artifact ---\r\n.nojekyll\r\n404.html\r\nabout.html\r\nassets/favicon.svg\r\nassets/main.js\r\nassets/styles.css\r\nblog.html\r\nblog/graph-neural-networks-connectomics.html\r\nblog/interpretable-deep-learning-neuroscience.html\r\nblog/machine-learning-single-cell-genomics.html\r\nindex.html\r\npublications.html\r\n\r\n--- artifact size ---\r\n116K    public\r\n\r\n"]
