[340.790628, "o", "\r\u001b[2KValidation passes, including HTML structure, internal links, required content, and the security audit. I’ll do a final visual/semantic spot check of the \r\ngenerated markup, then initialize git and prepare the commit and push/run commands.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app/my_website && printf '%s\\n' '--- index head/nav/hero ---' && sed -n '1,95p' index.html && printf '%s\\n' '--- publications semantics ---' && grep -nE \r\n'publication-card|data-filter|Search publications|Copy citation|aria-pressed' publications.html | head -20 && printf '%s\\n' '--- blog post nav paths ---' && \r\ngrep -nE 'stylesheet|assets/main|brand|nav-list|back-link' blog/interpretable-deep-learning-neuroscience.html | head -20\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠇\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
