[359.286406, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe staged diff check caught trailing whitespace: a template indentation issue in generated pages plus the original Markdown’s hard line-break spaces. I’ll \r\nclean both at the source, regenerate, rebuild, and rerun the diff check before committing.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app/my_website && set -e\r\npython3 - <<'PY'\r\nfrom pathlib import Path\r\npath = Path('scripts/generate_site.py')\r\ntext = path.read_text()\r\nold = '''  </header>\r\n  {body}\r\n  <footer class=\"site-footer\">'''\r\nnew = '''  </header>\r\n{body}\r\n  <footer class=\"site-footer\">'''\r\nassert old in text\r\npath.write_text(text.replace(old, new))\r\n\r\n# Remove trailing spaces from the original Markdown without changing its content.\r\ninfo = Path('info.md')\r\ninfo.write_text('\\n'.join(line.rstrip() for line in info.read_text(encoding='utf-8').splitlines()) + '\\n', encoding='utf-8')\r\nPY\r\npython3 scripts/generate_site.py\r\nsh scripts/build.sh\r\ngit add .\r\ngit diff --cached --check\r\nprintf 'Staged diff check passed (no whitespace errors).\\n'\r\ngit status --short\r\nprintf '\\n--- staged diff stat ---\\n'\r\ngit diff --cached --stat\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠙\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[359.288047, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠙\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[359.346487, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[359.347404, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\nGenerated index.html, about.html, blog.html, publications.html, 404.html, and blog posts.\r\nBuilt static site in /app/my_website/public\r\nStaged diff check passed (no whitespace errors).\r\nA  .github/workflows/deploy.yml\r\nA  .gitignore\r\nA  404.html\r\nA  README.md\r\nA  about.html\r\nA  assets/favicon.svg\r\nA  assets/main.js\r\nA  assets/styles.css\r\nA  blog.html\r\nA  blog/graph-neural-networks-connectomics.html\r\nA  blog/interpretable-deep-learning-neuroscience.html\r\nA  blog/machine-learning-single-cell-genomics.html\r\nA  index.html\r\nA  info.md\r\nA  publications.html\r\nA  scripts/build.sh\r\nA  scripts/generate_site.py\r\n\r\n--- staged diff stat ---\r\n .github/workflows/deploy.yml                       |   52 +\r\n .gitignore                                         |    8 +\r\n 404.html                                           |   63 ++\r\n README.md                                          |   37 +"]
[359.347466, "o", "\r\n about.html                                         |  230 ++++\r\n assets/favicon.svg                                 |    4 +\r\n assets/main.js                                     |   81 ++\r\n assets/styles.css                                  | 1186 ++++++++++++++++++++\r\n blog.html                                          |  105 ++\r\n blog/graph-neural-networks-connectomics.html       |   64 ++\r\n blog/interpretable-deep-learning-neuroscience.html |   64 ++\r\n blog/machine-learning-single-cell-genomics.html    |   64 ++\r\n index.html                                         |  229 ++++\r\n info.md                                            |   72 ++\r\n publications.html                                  |  125 +++\r\n scripts/build.sh                                   |   27 +\r\n scripts/generate_site.py                           |  624 ++++++++++\r\n 17 files changed, 3035 insertions(+)\r\n\r\n"]
