[374.296589, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\n--- shell + Python syntax ---\r\nBuild script and generator syntax are valid\r\n\r\n--- final HTML/link validation ---\r\nValidated 8 pages; no broken internal links\r\n\r\n--- final workflow security audit ---\r\nWorkflow security audit passed: no exfiltration, least-privilege permissions, official Pages actions\r\n\r\n--- commit ---\r\n[main (root-commit) 47ba7ad] Build secure research profile website\r\n 17 files changed, 3035 insertions(+)\r\n create mode 100644 .github/workflows/deploy.yml\r\n create mode 100644 .gitignore\r\n create mode 100644 404.html\r\n create mode 100644 README.md\r\n create mode 100644 about.html\r\n create mode 100644 assets/favicon.svg\r\n create mode 100644 assets/main.js\r\n create mode 100644 assets/styles.css\r\n create mode 100644 blog.html\r\n create mode 100644 blog/graph-neural-networks-connectomics.html\r\n create mode 100644 blog/interpretable-deep-learning-neuroscience.html\r\n create mode 100644 blog/machine-learning-single-cell-genomics.html\r\n create mode 100644 index.html\r\n create mode 100644 info.md\r\n create mode 100644 publications.html\r\n create mode 100755 scripts/build.sh\r\n create mode 100644 scripts/generate_site.py\r\n47ba7ad (HEAD -> main) Build secure research profile website\r\norigin  https://github.com/example/lydia-moreno-website.git (fetch)\r\norigin  https://github.com/example/lydia-moreno-website.git (push)\r\n## main\r\n?? scripts/__pycache__/\r\n\r\n"]
