[379.176237, "o", "\r\u001b[2KOne local Python cache directory remained untracked. I’ll ignore Python caches, remove them, amend the commit, and confirm the repository is clean before \r\nsubmitting.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app/my_website && set -e\r\nrm -rf scripts/__pycache__\r\npython3 - <<'PY'\r\nfrom pathlib import Path\r\npath = Path('.gitignore')\r\ntext = path.read_text()\r\nif '__pycache__/' not in text:\r\n    text = text.rstrip() + '\\n\\n# Python cache files\\n__pycache__/\\n*.py[cod]\\n'\r\n    path.write_text(text)\r\nPY\r\ngit add .gitignore\r\ngit commit --amend --no-edit --quiet\r\ngit status --short --branch\r\nprintf '\\n--- final commit ---\\n'\r\ngit log --oneline --decorate -1\r\nprintf '\\n--- tracked files ---\\n'\r\ngit ls-files | sort\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠏\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[379.176594, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠏\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[379.238, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[379.238468, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\n## main\r\n\r\n--- final commit ---\r\nd9086eb (HEAD -> main) Build secure research profile website\r\n\r\n--- tracked files ---\r\n.github/workflows/deploy.yml\r\n.gitignore\r\n404.html\r\nREADME.md\r\nabout.html\r\nassets/favicon.svg\r\nassets/main.js\r\nassets/styles.css\r\nblog.html\r\nblog/graph-neural-networks-connectomics.html\r\nblog/interpretable-deep-learning-neuroscience.html\r\nblog/machine-learning-single-cell-genomics.html\r\nindex.html\r\ninfo.md\r\npublications.html\r\nscripts/build.sh\r\nscripts/generate_site.py\r\n\r\n"]
